{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Rockman sighs \"Leaf... There is nothing wrong i promise.\" He looks to her lovingly with a sparkle in his eyes. \"I hate you.\"\n\n The instant he says this he starts pounding his head repeatedly as he stands and backs away. Rush wines as he curls up to Leaf. Rush begins to tremble while looking at Rockman. He paces around in a panic, constantly looking over at Leaf. Giving her a pleading look. He drops to his knees in front of her.","created_at":"2020-08-12T08:45:02.267000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743027254564487218","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
