{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"When she's finished, Leaf takes a deep breath and lets out a long sigh. She looks up to him and says in Goblin ||\"Don't worry. We'll figure this out together. I love you, and I know you do too.\"|| She kisses him before curling up in his arms","created_at":"2020-08-12T09:28:49.162000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743038272560824360","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
