{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf falls asleep worried, and it's even worse given her memories of the last time strange things were happening. She remembers what she told herself when she tore up the note from Copper. That no lies or secret plots could take away her truth. Back then that only included her love for Mello, but now that includes her love for Rock as well. ||Mello, please. Something is wrong with Rock. You know how much he means to me. I'm scared...||","created_at":"2020-08-12T10:09:12.641000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743048437368619110","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf blinks awake but doesn't move. She sits in Rockman's arms for a few minutes, just thinking. Thinking over everything he said last night, trying to place when this happened and how. She sighs. These things won't get solved if she just thinks about them. She gently moves to kiss Rock on the cheek. In goblin she says softly, ||\"Love you. And it's alright if you can't say it today. I know you do too.\"||","created_at":"2020-08-12T16:31:34.491000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743144662461841419","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"After a while of thinking, Leaf carefully moves out of Rock's arms to quietly get her calligrapher's kit. She knows that he's not technically sleeping, but still wants to respect his version of it. She moves back to sit crisscross next to him and starts taking notes in goblin, recalling the events of last night as best she can.\n\n||```Was also acting strange before. Not talking, only yes and no. So assuming this was a problem before the Howler fight...\n\n-Sandi isn't around?\n-Wanted to Identify for Lilia and Cato\n\nFrom last night:\n\n-Theres something wrong, there's a spell (?)\n-Knight cloak dim???\n-Did not make the goggles\n-Theres. Something. Wrong.\n-He loves me.```||\n\nThere's definitely a lot of question marks on the paper, and her writing is a bit more heavy handed and rushed than usual.","created_at":"2020-08-12T18:23:21.536000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743172793847382099","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
